<title>USA: Docucon knows no reason for stock activity.</title>
<headline>Docucon knows no reason for stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Docucon Inc on Monday said it did not know &quot;of any corporate reason&quot; for the accelerated trading in its stock and a rise in its share price.</p>
</text>
